{{ MD.chosen_params.min_child_samples | int }} rows per leaf, feature fraction
{{ MD.chosen_params.feature_fraction | num(1) }}, {{ MD.num_rounds_full | int }} rounds
(mean early-stopping round across folds). Mean CV PR-AUC
{{ MD.cv_pr_auc_mean | num(4) }} (standard deviation {{ MD.cv_pr_auc_std | num(4) }}).
The no-velocity model uses the same parameters, {{ MD.n_features_no_velocity | int }}
